operations.activity_diagram:
@startuml
start
:Employee opens app - S-01 Iniciar sesión;
if (Both fields filled? (BR-001)) then (no)
  :Spanish per-field required errors;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
:Tap primary button - locked while the fake authentication resolves (BR-003);
:FakeAuthService checks the credential pair in memory - no network request (BR-041);
if (Credentials == admin/admin?) then (yes)
  :Store fake session token in the in-memory TokenStore fake (mock-phase BR-006);
  :Navigate to S-02 Mis incidencias;
  stop
else (no)
  :Generic inline error - no account-existence hint (BR-002, INSTR-007);
  :Form state preserved;
  stop
endif
@enduml

@startuml
start
:Tap incident card on S-02 -> navigate S-04 with id;
:Load detail from in-memory FakeIncidentRepository - owner-scoped, no network (BR-041);
if (Owned seeded id?) then (yes)
  :Render detail card (ID, title + status badge, description, Categoría/Prioridad/Estado/Fecha);
  :Reverse ascending history -> "Historial de estados" newest-first, "Creación — Pendiente" initial entry, latest highlighted;
  :"Mis incidencias" back to S-02;
  stop
else (no - missing or foreign, indistinguishable)
  :Safe no-access state "Incidencia no disponible" + hint (BR-010);
  stop
endif
@enduml

@startuml
start
:Operator requests ./gradlew check :app:assembleDebug from apps/mobile;
:check suite runs (unit + Compose tests, ktlint, lint) - zero secrets required;
if (check suite passes?) then (no)
  :Build fails with the standard Gradle report - no signing configuration exists to fail;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
:app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk produced - no keystore, no key.properties, no ANDROID_KEY* variables (BR-037);
:Operator installs the APK on a portrait phone;
:Reviewer demos the mock journey offline: admin/admin sign-in -> seeded list/filter -> create -> detail -> sign-out (BR-041);
:Local artifact only - no upload, no publication (BR-038);
stop
@enduml
